📗
  🗄 An ordered collection of header fields. Names are case-insensitive, and a
  name can appear more than once.

    🆕🗄❗️ ➡️ headers
    🔖 headers 🔤Content-Type🔤 🔤text/plain🔤❗️      💭 set, replacing
    📎 headers 🔤Set-Cookie🔤 🔤a=1🔤❗️                💭 add, keeping others
    🏷 headers 🔤content-type🔤❗️                     💭 first value
📗
🐇 🗄 🍇
  🖍🆕 names 🍨🐚🔡🍆
  🖍🆕 keys 🍨🐚🔡🍆
  🖍🆕 values 🍨🐚🔡🍆

  🆕 🍇
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍names
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍keys
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍values
  🍉

  📗
    *value* with CR, LF and zero bytes removed, and spaces and tabs trimmed
    from both ends. This is what stops a header value from starting a new line.
  📗
  🐇❗️ 🧼 value 🔡 ➡️ 🔡 🍇
    📇 value❗️ ➡️ data
    🆕🧳❗️ ➡️ out
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 📏 data❓❗️ 🍇
      💧🐇🧮 data i❗️ ➡️ byte
      ↪️ ❎ 🤜byte 🙌 13 👐 byte 🙌 10 👐 byte 🙌 0🤛❗️ 🍇
        💧 out byte❗️
      🍉
    🍉
    ↪️ 🔡🐇🧮 📤 out❗️❗️ ➡️ clean 🍇
      ↩️ 🧽🐇🧰 clean❗️
    🍉
    ↩️ 🔤🔤
  🍉

  📗 Adds a field, keeping any that already have this name. Ignored when *name* is not a token. 📗
  ❗️ 📎 name 🔡 value 🔡 🍇
    ↪️ 🎟🐇🧮 name❗️ 🍇
      🐻 names name❗️
      🐻 keys 📪🐇🧮 name❗️❗️
      🐻 values 🧼🐇🗄 value❗️❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 Removes every field called *name*. 📗
  ❗️ 🐨 name 🔡 🍇
    📪🐇🧮 name❗️ ➡️ key
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕keptNames
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕keptKeys
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕keptValues
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 📏 keys❓❗️ 🍇
      ↪️ ❎ 🐽 keys i❗️ 🙌 key❗️ 🍇
        🐻 keptNames 🐽 names i❗️❗️
        🐻 keptKeys 🐽 keys i❗️❗️
        🐻 keptValues 🐽 values i❗️❗️
      🍉
    🍉
    keptNames ➡️ 🖍names
    keptKeys ➡️ 🖍keys
    keptValues ➡️ 🖍values
  🍉

  📗 Sets a field, replacing any that already have this name. Ignored when *name* is not a token. 📗
  ❗️ 🔖 name 🔡 value 🔡 🍇
    ↪️ 🎟🐇🧮 name❗️ 🍇
      🐨 👇 name❗️
      📎 👇 name value❗️
    🍉
  🍉

  📗 The first value of *name*. 📗
  ❗️ 🏷 name 🔡 ➡️ 🍬🔡 🍇
    📪🐇🧮 name❗️ ➡️ key
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 📏 keys❓❗️ 🍇
      ↪️ 🐽 keys i❗️ 🙌 key 🍇
        ↩️ 🐽 values i❗️
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ 🤷‍♀️
  🍉

  📗 Every value of *name*, in order. 📗
  ❗️ 📚 name 🔡 ➡️ 🍨🐚🔡🍆 🍇
    📪🐇🧮 name❗️ ➡️ key
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕found
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 📏 keys❓❗️ 🍇
      ↪️ 🐽 keys i❗️ 🙌 key 🍇
        🐻 found 🐽 values i❗️❗️
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ found
  🍉

  📗
    Every value of *name* joined into one: with "; " for cookie, otherwise
    with ", ". No value when there is no such field.
  📗
  ❗️ 🧷 name 🔡 ➡️ 🍬🔡 🍇
    📚 👇 name❗️ ➡️ all
    ↪️ 📏 all❓ 🙌 0 🍇
      ↩️ 🤷‍♀️
    🍉
    ↪️ 📪🐇🧮 name❗️ 🙌 🔤cookie🔤 🍇
      ↩️ 🆕🔡 all 🔤; 🔤❗️
    🍉
    ↩️ 🆕🔡 all 🔤, 🔤❗️
  🍉

  📗 Whether there is a field called *name*. 📗
  ❗️ 🐣 name 🔡 ➡️ 👌 🍇
    📪🐇🧮 name❗️ ➡️ key
    🔂 existing keys 🍇
      ↪️ existing 🙌 key 🍇
        ↩️ 👍
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ 👎
  🍉

  📗 Number of fields. 📗
  ❗️ 📐 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ 📏 keys❓
  🍉

  📗 The distinct lower-cased names, in the order they first appeared. 📗
  ❗️ 🐙 ➡️ 🍨🐚🔡🍆 🍇
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕distinct
    🔂 key keys 🍇
      👎 ➡️ 🖍🆕seen
      🔂 earlier distinct 🍇
        ↪️ earlier 🙌 key 🍇
          👍 ➡️ 🖍seen
        🍉
      🍉
      ↪️ ❎ seen❗️ 🍇
        🐻 distinct key❗️
      🍉
    🍉
    ↩️ distinct
  🍉

  📗 One "Name: value" line per field, in order, without line endings. 📗
  ❗️ 📃 ➡️ 🍨🐚🔡🍆 🍇
    🆕🍨🐚🔡🍆❗️ ➡️ 🖍🆕lines
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 📏 keys❓❗️ 🍇
      💭 Bound to variables first: interpolating 🐽 directly miscompiles.
      🐽 names i❗️ ➡️ name
      🐽 values i❗️ ➡️ value
      🐻 lines 🔤🧲name🧲: 🧲value🧲🔤❗️
    🍉
    ↩️ lines
  🍉
